# Hover over the STDLIB surface the documentation arc filled in: a union ARM,
# a CONVERSION, a container MEMBER and an OPERATOR. Before the arc each
# answered with a bare signature and nothing else.
#
# The operator hover is pinned as `null` on purpose. `+` IS a declaration in
# system.z and it carries a doc, but zls does not resolve a hover position onto
# an operator token, so the doc it has cannot be reached. That is a language
# server gap, not a documentation one.

main: function is {
    e: io.IoError.notfound
    match (
        e
    ) case notfound then {
        print "missing"
    } else {
        print "other"
    }
    b: 255.u8
    one: 1.u8
    s: b + one
    w: b.i16
    xs: (List String)
    n: xs.length
    print "\{s} \{w} \{n}"
}
